":\"Soho\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.5128,\"longitude\":-0.1305},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"99 Shaftesbury Avenue,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"W1D 5DY\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006677\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hamnet\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award® winning writer/director Chloé Zhao, HAMNET tells the powerful love story that inspired the creation of Shakespeare’s timeless masterpiece, Hamlet.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, brief moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":126,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9Tv9wGPxIw\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000175\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001040\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001087\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002310\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004702\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004703\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007765\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c566d7dc-50bb-4d55-984b-c4c65751933e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006677\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008241\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006679\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying. \\r\\n\\r\\nCUSTOMER NOTICE: This screening is restricted to viewers aged 18 and over. Valid identification must be presented at admission.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rl_DJZCyEH4\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001245\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012802\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"ce27f9c4-2b7c-4839-b9e6-0ceceb8e7949\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006679\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008243\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006681\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Voice of Hind Rajab\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"January 29, 2024. Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A 6-year old girl is trapped in a car under fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. While trying to keep her on the line, they do everything they can to get an ambulance to her. Her name was Hind Rajab.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Red Crescent volunteers receive an emergency call. A 6-year old girl is trapped in a car under IDF fire in Gaza, pleading for rescue. Her name was Hind Rajab.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"distressing scenes, strong threat, images of real dead bodies\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":89,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001301\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012772\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012773\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012774\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e118aebf-d685-4703-8fb5-88305b5e28da\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006681\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008245\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Altitude Film Distribution\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006689\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"No Other Choice\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012169\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012827\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012828\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012829\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012830\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012831\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9ecc0908-a983-42f7-9591-6f8d73d7488b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006689\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008255\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006715\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"LSFF: So Long To the Valleys, So Long To the Seas\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Costume and performance sit alongside ancient stories of moorland beasts and mystical Roma lore, from Norwegian trolls to West African tribal masks.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe stories here are equal parts playful and creative, harsh and traumatic, illustrating opposing aspects of folk beliefs.\\r\\n\\r\\nLSFF regulars Andrew Kötting (Gallivant) and Edward Smyth return with latest works that playfully investigate costume and games. While LSFF alumni animator Yasmine Djedje-Fisher-Azoume investigates her Ivory Coast ancestral roots, Edith Morris returns with another Super-8 gem, and Bim Adjadi continues his investigation into deafness and the Black British experience. \\r\\n\\r\\nThe attending filmmakers will join us for a Q&A following the screening.\\r\\n\\r\\n- Hope Holds Up Her Head and Hopes, dir. Andrew Kötting, UK 2025, 14mins\\r\\n- Dédé (Ancestor), dir. Yasmine Djedje-Fisher-Azoume, UK 2024, 3mins\\r\\n- The Spectacle, dir. Bálint Kenyeres, France, Hungary 2025, 17mins\\r\\n- Trolsk, dir. edith morris, UK 2025, 5mins\\r\\n- Deliverance, dir. Bim Ajadi, UK 2025, 14mins\\r\\n- Agáta, dir. Benedetta Fiore, Czech Republic 2024, 7mins\\r\\n- The Golden Squacco Heron, dir. Edward Smyth, UK 2025, 6mins\\r\\n- The Genesis Project, dir. Camilla Greenwell, UK 2025, 4mins\\r\\n- A Bear Remembers, dir. Hannah Palumbo, Linden Feng, UK 2024, 20mins\\r\\n\\r\\nContent / Trigger Warnings: Contains scenes of harm towards children.\\r\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A journey through global storytelling and folkloric landscapes, where traditions can hold stories of both great celebration and lasting pain.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012957\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012958\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012959\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012960\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012961\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012962\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012963\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012964\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012965\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012966\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000025\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006715\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008287\",\"eventId\":\"0000000024\",\"distributorName\":\"London Short Film Festival\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006609\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":149,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNDVyJU99M0\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001403\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001416\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002090\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003985\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003988\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007063\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007210\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011162\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011923\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12808\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12809\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12810\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e033d58e-8545-4f81-a191-03352ebe4cc0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006609\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008158\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Entertainment Film Distributors\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006610\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Sentimental Value\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Nora Borg (Renate Reinsve) is an established Oslo stage actress; her younger sister Agnes (Inga Ibsdotter Lilleaas) has chosen family life with her young son. Though markedly different, the two are close and deeply intertwined, having been raised by a single mother after their filmmaker father’s departure years earlier. When the once renowned Gustav (Stellan Skarsgård) attempts to cast Nora in his comeback film, old wounds bleed anew; \\\"Nora rejects his offer, prompting the isolated patriarch to cast American star Rachel Kemp (Elle Fanning), who gradually comes to realize she has unwittingly become part of a deeply personal film drama. Agnes, meanwhile, delves deeper into the family history as Gustav and Nora attempt rapprochement; but the cracks at the base of the family home run deeper than any Borg can grasp, threatening to topple an already shaky foundation.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis special preview is presented in partnership with The Observer and will feature a post-film conversation between film critic Wendy Ide and leading actor Stellan Skarsgård.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Sisters Nora and Agnes reunite with their estranged father, the charismatic Gustav, a once renowned director who offers stage actress Nora a role.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, suicide references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":133,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gb1sSfWb1Og\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001057\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001058\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001695\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002275\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002626\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002629\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002630\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003236\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008105\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012671\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012672\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012673\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012674\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\