inema Remembers What We Forget, the underlying current in this year’s programme, explores how artists confront memory and identity - the fragments that linger beneath the surface: the messy, the emotional, the defiant and the unfiltered. \\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"endDate\":\"2026-02-01\"},\"siteIds\":[\"SOH1\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[{\"id\":\"SOH1-113-HO00006609\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006609\",\"siteId\":\"SOH1\",\"bookingPeriods\":[{\"startsAt\":\"2025-11-26T00:01:00+00:00\",\"orderBookingModes\":[\"Paid\",\"Unpaid\",\"UnpaidConfirmed\"],\"restriction\":\"None\",\"rewardId\":null}]}],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"SOH1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}",
